OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh Greens back plan to separate
OL,4,Afrom English party                     
OL,6,FMembers of the Green Party in Wales    
OL,7,Fhave backed plans to split from their  
OL,8,Fcolleagues in England and form their   
OL,9,Fown independent party.                 
OL,11,FThe Welsh Green conference in Bangor on
OL,12,FSunday supported a motion setting out a
OL,13,Ftimetable to split by 2035, subject to 
OL,14,Fa further vote of party members.       
OL,16,FBBC Wales was told the changes were    
OL,17,Fendorsed by a large majority of members
OL,18,Fwho attended.                          
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
